or policy disposition. No production code, setting, gate, exact-head approval or landing is claimed; R14 stays open. The two documentation paths passed git diff --check, 713-link checking (0 broken), and check-notes (0 warnings). The ordinary gate is due before any exact-head review. Archive exact-build mapping still preempts when request 47777d9a is answered.","body":{"conditions":"Decide the concrete telemetry/index/profile/budget/window proposal and the required strength of retirement evidence; assign the bounded implementation scope separately under R14 as c0832d1f item 3 requires. This response owes a decision report, not a Git artifact. No telemetry implementation, deployment, query, retirement conclusion, parent completion or landing is authorized by this request alone.","no_git_artifact":"true","to":"20db43a245e9780b92a587425d387d393b17ffc90b89e036ff752399f88fc517"}}